  "goodToKnow": "Dampfen means to steam, give off steam: Die Suppe dampft. Today it also means to vape: E-Zigaretten dampfen. Careful: dämpfen, with an umlaut, means to steam food (Gemüse dämpfen) or to dampen. Der Dampf is steam: Dampf ablassen (to let off steam), Dampf machen (to put pressure on). Der Dampfer is a steamship, and auf dem falschen Dampfer sein means to be barking up the wrong tree."
